      "name": "Swarm monitor sweep and handover sync",
      "summary": "Executes one stall-safe Swarm Monitor check-in sweep inside Process_SwarmDispatchAndMonitor: extracts live worker progress, measures repository queues and host CPU, disk, and compressed or swapped memory, intervenes on leaks or stalls, assigns right-scoped no…",
      "description": "Executes one stall-safe Swarm Monitor check-in sweep inside Process_SwarmDispatchAndMonitor: extracts live worker progress, measures repository queues and host CPU, disk, and compressed or swapped memory, intervenes on leaks or stalls, assigns right-scoped non-heavy idle-backlog work to workers waiting on single-core compute without checking out mid-build, refreshes and pushes the parent Swarm Work Item's Cold-Start Handover Runbook to the shared beans store on every sweep, and publishes the standardized two-table Human-Consumable Swarm Status Report when requested on-demand or scheduled periodically.",
      "enforcement": "strict",
      "sourcePath": "sdlc/processes/swarm-dispatch-and-monitor-sweep.bpmn",
